#: ../../SECURITY.md:2
msgid "Security"
msgstr "安全"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:4
msgid "Reporting a vulnerability"
msgstr "报告漏洞"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:6
msgid ""
"Report vulnerabilities through GitHub's private vulnerability reporting "
"for this repository. Select \"Report a vulnerability\" under the Security"
" tab. Do not open a public issue for anything you believe is exploitable."
msgstr ""
"请通过 GitHub 上本仓库的私密漏洞报告功能提交：在 Security 标签页下点 \"Report a "
"vulnerability\"。只要你觉得问题可能被利用，就不要开公开 issue。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:10
msgid ""
"Expect an acknowledgement within a few days. We will tell you what we "
"found, what we changed, and when the change shipped."
msgstr "一般几天内会回复确认。之后我们会告诉你查到了什么、改了什么，以及修复在什么时候发布。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:13
msgid "What is in scope"
msgstr "受理范围"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:15
msgid ""
"The control plane, web app, runner host, and sandbox image in this "
"repository."
msgstr "本仓库中的控制平面、Web 应用、runner 主机和沙箱镜像。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:16
msgid ""
"The HTTP contracts under `gateway_contracts/`, as consumed by this "
"service."
msgstr "`gateway_contracts/` 下的 HTTP 契约，仅限本服务使用它们的方式。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:18
msgid ""
"The gateway that this service authenticates against is a separate "
"project: HybridInference. Report gateway issues there."
msgstr "本服务依赖网关做身份验证，但网关属于另一个项目 HybridInference。网关的问题请到那边报告。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:21
msgid "What a deployment must not assume"
msgstr "部署时不能想当然的地方"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:23
msgid ""
"`AGENTS.md` and `docs/developer/operations.md` describe the threat model "
"for this service. Two deployment requirements bear repeating:"
msgstr "本服务的威胁模型写在 `AGENTS.md` 和 `docs/developer/operations.md` 里。有两条部署要求，这里再强调一遍："

#: ../../SECURITY.md:26
msgid ""
"The plain Docker runner profile isolates trusted repositories from each "
"other. It does not isolate hostile code from the host. Do not offer it to"
" untrusted users."
msgstr "普通 Docker 的 runner 配置只能把受信任的仓库彼此隔开，挡不住恶意代码攻击主机。不要把它开放给不受信任的用户。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:29
msgid ""
"The sandbox never holds a long-lived gateway credential. It receives a "
"short-lived, job-scoped grant. Putting an admin token into a sandbox "
"removes the security property that this design rests on."
msgstr "沙箱里永远不放长期有效的网关凭据，只拿到一个短期、仅限当前任务的授权。一旦把管理员令牌放进沙箱，这套设计赖以成立的安全前提就不存在了。"

